  "title": "Lancaster Lefsa (Old World Recipe)",
  "description": "Thin, potato-dough unleavened breads called lefsa are traditional in Scandinavia; this old world recipe was passed down by a Swedish family.",
  "authors": [
    "KelleyJo Lancaster"
  ],
